1
00:01:33,920 --> 00:01:35,040
You want to join the training team?

2
00:01:35,680 --> 00:01:36,840
I'm afraid it won't be that easy.

3
00:01:37,880 --> 00:01:39,760
Please, help me figure something out.

4
00:01:40,120 --> 00:01:41,400
I'll do anything.

5
00:01:42,760 --> 00:01:44,640
There actually is one way.

6
00:01:45,120 --> 00:01:45,680
But...

7
00:01:46,040 --> 00:01:47,120
Please, just tell me.

8
00:01:47,440 --> 00:01:48,200
The training team...

9
00:01:48,320 --> 00:01:50,840
currently has an opening for a Logistics Support Team Leader.

10
00:01:51,080 --> 00:01:51,760
I'll do it.

11
00:01:51,760 --> 00:01:53,680
Don't agree so quickly.

12
00:01:55,600 --> 00:01:58,320
Although the Logistics Support Team Leader is part of the team,

13
00:01:58,320 --> 00:02:00,400
you won't participate in the training itself.

14
00:02:00,520 --> 00:02:02,040
You'll only be responsible for logistics.

15
00:02:02,640 --> 00:02:04,080
A graduate student like you...

16
00:02:04,440 --> 00:02:05,240
is willing to do that?

17
00:02:06,080 --> 00:02:06,720
I am.

18
00:02:07,440 --> 00:02:09,320
There is no high or low in military work.

19
00:02:09,320 --> 00:02:11,360
Every position has its indispensable function.

20
00:02:11,760 --> 00:02:14,440
Even pouring tea, sweeping, or serving meals,

21
00:02:14,840 --> 00:02:15,880
someone has to do it, right?

22
00:02:16,880 --> 00:02:18,560
Although it's far from my goal,

23
00:02:18,880 --> 00:02:20,640
as long as I get into the training team,

24
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:21,960
what I learn is up to me.

25
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:24,800
Is that really what you think?

26
00:02:24,920 --> 00:02:25,720
It really is.

27
00:02:27,440 --> 00:02:28,080
Good.

28
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:30,720
That's the Guo Zijian I want to see.

29
00:02:32,240 --> 00:02:33,440
I'll report this to the superiors.

30
00:02:33,440 --> 00:02:34,640
But as for the outcome,

31
00:02:36,080 --> 00:02:37,400
you need to prepare for both possibilities.

32
00:02:37,760 --> 00:02:39,560
I still need to prepare for both outcomes?

33
00:02:39,840 --> 00:02:40,880
I've heard everything.

34
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:42,480
The training is here in our Training Unit.

35
00:02:42,560 --> 00:02:44,040
It's close by and convenient for me.

36
00:02:44,600 --> 00:02:46,720
Your situation is different, Guo Zijian.

37
00:02:46,920 --> 00:02:48,040
After we finish our review,

38
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:49,800
we still have to report to the Group Army.

39
00:02:50,040 --> 00:02:51,280
They have to approve it.

40
00:02:51,920 --> 00:02:53,720
I don't care. I know you have a way.

41
00:02:54,080 --> 00:02:55,360
Thank you in advance, sir.

42
00:02:56,360 --> 00:02:57,680
All right, you can go back.

43
00:02:57,840 --> 00:02:58,400
Yes, sir.

44
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:01,080
Commissar.

45
00:03:01,480 --> 00:03:02,120
Hurry up.

46
00:03:02,600 --> 00:03:03,320
I know.

47
00:03:16,600 --> 00:03:17,640
Reporting.

48
00:03:18,160 --> 00:03:18,840
Come in.

49
00:03:25,880 --> 00:03:28,160
Sir, about Guo Zijian...

50
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:29,760
Could we make an exception?

51
00:03:30,280 --> 00:03:31,040
How can we make an exception?

52
00:03:32,120 --> 00:03:33,240
He is at the center of public opinion.

53
00:03:33,320 --> 00:03:34,280
You tell me how to make an exception.

54
00:03:38,480 --> 00:03:39,080
Have a seat.

55
00:03:46,320 --> 00:03:47,760
Let's skip what happened before.

56
00:03:48,080 --> 00:03:49,680
He's been removed as battalion commander.

57
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:51,160
But think back on it.

58
00:03:51,400 --> 00:03:52,200
At the Training Unit,

59
00:03:52,200 --> 00:03:53,960
how beautifully he fought Long Yuanshan.

60
00:03:54,520 --> 00:03:55,040
Also,

61
00:03:55,400 --> 00:03:56,960
the special ops squad he led himself

62
00:03:57,240 --> 00:03:58,160
in the graduation competition,

63
00:03:58,360 --> 00:04:00,000
won the Group Army championship.

64
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:03,200
By all accounts, during the training,

65
00:04:03,200 --> 00:04:04,240
we should give him a position.

66
00:04:05,120 --> 00:04:05,960
So you're saying

67
00:04:06,560 --> 00:04:08,320
his stylish flying kick

68
00:04:08,320 --> 00:04:09,520
can just be ignored?

69
00:04:13,720 --> 00:04:14,720
Then what should we do?

70
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:16,519
We can make it happen.

71
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:17,560
Ling Jun,

72
00:04:18,959 --> 00:04:20,839
if Guo Zijian can only rely on our support

73
00:04:20,839 --> 00:04:21,760
to make progress,

74
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:23,840
then such progress is worthless,

75
00:04:24,520 --> 00:04:26,360
and it's unfair to the others.

76
00:04:27,680 --> 00:04:28,440
But Sir,

77
00:04:29,400 --> 00:04:31,160
when we poached him in the first place,

78
00:04:31,240 --> 00:04:32,920
wasn't it for today's training?

79
00:04:33,320 --> 00:04:34,680
Logically speaking, this move,

80
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:37,080
was flawless from layout to execution.

81
00:04:37,640 --> 00:04:39,960
But now there's a problem with the piece.

82
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:41,800
He acts on his own

83
00:04:42,400 --> 00:04:43,640
and always tries to break the rules.

84
00:04:45,480 --> 00:04:46,560
Tell me, what should I do?

85
00:04:47,240 --> 00:04:47,600
Then,

86
00:04:48,640 --> 00:04:50,480
are we really keeping Guo Zijian out?

87
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:53,680
Ling Jun.

88
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:58,880
Kang Baoping, 396th Brigade Commissar,

89
00:04:59,160 --> 00:05:01,040
is an old hand at managing personnel.

90
00:05:01,520 --> 00:05:03,000
Yet you never give him credit.

91
00:05:03,760 --> 00:05:04,280
Old Kang...

92
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:06,160
what brilliant move did he make?

93
00:05:07,440 --> 00:05:09,360
Here's the training roster just submitted.

94
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:11,320
Take a good look at it.

95
00:05:24,040 --> 00:05:25,200
Logistics Support Team Leader

96
00:05:28,320 --> 00:05:29,320
Old Kang...

97
00:05:29,320 --> 00:05:30,880
is truly a seasoned political officer.

98
00:05:30,880 --> 00:05:31,560
I have to hand it to him.

99
00:05:31,720 --> 00:05:32,720
Logistics Support Team Leader?

100
00:05:33,120 --> 00:05:34,000
How is that possible?

101
00:05:34,200 --> 00:05:35,400
Why wouldn't it be?

102
00:05:35,760 --> 00:05:36,880
The list has already been submitted.

103
00:05:37,480 --> 00:05:38,560
As for Guo Zijian,

104
00:05:39,160 --> 00:05:40,040
I can sum him up simply:

105
00:05:40,800 --> 00:05:41,880
He had it coming.

106
00:05:42,720 --> 00:05:45,040
Last drill, Guo Zijian and a dozen men

107
00:05:45,360 --> 00:05:47,040
almost captured Long Yuanshan.

108
00:05:48,240 --> 00:05:49,360
I was hoping that during this training,

109
00:05:49,360 --> 00:05:50,160
I could go head-to-head with him.

110
00:05:52,440 --> 00:05:53,720
Why bother doing that?

111
00:05:54,360 --> 00:05:56,200
Isn't it nice to have one less rival?

112
00:05:56,200 --> 00:05:57,640
A rival is a rival.

113
00:05:57,640 --> 00:05:59,240
Facing off directly makes it meaningful.

114
00:05:59,240 --> 00:06:00,640
Otherwise, it's a hollow victory.

115
00:06:02,200 --> 00:06:03,240
Short sword or long sword,

116
00:06:03,240 --> 00:06:04,960
a good sword wins tough battles.

117
00:06:05,240 --> 00:06:06,640
The process doesn't matter.

118
00:06:08,040 --> 00:06:10,680
Right, speaking of the last drill,

119
00:06:11,520 --> 00:06:12,760
it just reminded me of something.

120
00:06:13,120 --> 00:06:14,760
That matter wasn't so simple.

121
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:15,920
I've been looking into it for a while.

122
00:06:15,920 --> 00:06:17,920
And now I finally have some clues.

123
00:06:19,160 --> 00:06:20,400
This guy, Guo Zijian,

124
00:06:21,360 --> 00:06:22,160
plays dirty.

125
00:06:27,200 --> 00:06:28,000
What do you mean?

126
00:06:33,760 --> 00:06:35,880
Never mind. You'll find out soon enough.

127
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:44,840
Comrades,

128
00:06:45,560 --> 00:06:47,720
The New-Type Combat Forces core training

129
00:06:48,280 --> 00:06:50,840
is assigned to our Group Army

130
00:06:50,840 --> 00:06:54,200
as an exploratory and innovative

131
00:06:54,200 --> 00:06:55,040
important mission by the Theater Command.

132
00:06:55,800 --> 00:06:57,720
Every single one of you sitting here today

133
00:06:58,400 --> 00:07:00,160
can feel proud of yourselves,

134
00:07:01,040 --> 00:07:02,360
and feel honored,

135
00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:05,400
because you represent this era's

136
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:08,800
crucial frontier in Army development.

137
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:11,200
What are New-Type Combat Forces?

138
00:07:12,480 --> 00:07:14,360
In my view, they represent

139
00:07:15,440 --> 00:07:16,600
a new starting point,

140
00:07:17,200 --> 00:07:18,360
a generation point,

141
00:07:19,120 --> 00:07:21,640
an elevation point, and a breakthrough.

142
00:07:22,280 --> 00:07:23,120
Of course, there is one more,

143
00:07:23,640 --> 00:07:25,600
which is a new integration point.

144
00:07:26,800 --> 00:07:27,600
Comrades,

145
00:07:28,760 --> 00:07:30,120
how will future land battles be fought?

146
00:07:30,680 --> 00:07:31,280
Have you thought about it?

147
00:07:32,600 --> 00:07:34,040
This is a practical subject,

148
00:07:35,360 --> 00:07:37,240
as well as an exploratory one.

149
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:39,880
The Chinese Army,

150
00:07:41,200 --> 00:07:43,800
if it wants to uphold its historical responsibility,

151
00:07:44,360 --> 00:07:45,560
cannot stick to the old ways.

152
00:07:46,440 --> 00:07:49,040
It must build upon its glorious history

153
00:07:49,520 --> 00:07:51,760
and forge more combat power for the future.

154
00:08:05,120 --> 00:08:07,240
Look at you. What's so funny?

155
00:08:08,440 --> 00:08:10,200
Getting assigned to do logistics with me.

156
00:08:10,320 --> 00:08:10,920
Don't you feel wronged?

157
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:13,600
Well, maybe a little bit.

158
00:08:14,840 --> 00:08:15,440
But...

159
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:16,920
what matters most...

160
00:08:17,040 --> 00:08:18,320
is that I still get to work with you.

161
00:08:18,840 --> 00:08:20,000
See? What did I tell you?

162
00:08:20,480 --> 00:08:22,520
1st Battalion will be yours eventually.

163
00:08:23,200 --> 00:08:24,160
Stop talking nonsense.

164
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:26,000
How is it nonsense?

165
00:08:26,240 --> 00:08:27,880
Look, all these signs show

166
00:08:28,920 --> 00:08:30,280
that you've already stepped onto

167
00:08:30,280 --> 00:08:32,320
the golden path back to the 1st Battalion.

168
00:08:33,400 --> 00:08:34,559
According to my analysis,

169
00:08:35,559 --> 00:08:37,159
as long as you are here, Commander,

170
00:08:37,440 --> 00:08:39,159
even if we're in the mess squad,

171
00:08:39,159 --> 00:08:41,039
we still have chances to earn merits.

172
00:08:41,360 --> 00:08:41,840
Right?

173
00:08:42,559 --> 00:08:43,480
You're pretty confident.

174
00:08:43,720 --> 00:08:44,440
Of course.

175
00:08:44,960 --> 00:08:46,640
I'm mainly confident in you.

176
00:08:47,840 --> 00:08:48,920
Trust my judgment.

177
00:08:49,160 --> 00:08:49,720
Just wait and see.

178
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:51,600
This time,

179
00:08:52,440 --> 00:08:53,920
the training is on a tight schedule,

180
00:08:54,760 --> 00:08:56,600
so a lot of basic preparations

181
00:08:57,240 --> 00:08:58,320
can't be done perfectly in one go.

182
00:08:59,320 --> 00:08:59,840
Regarding this,

183
00:09:00,080 --> 00:09:01,240
I ask for your understanding.

184
00:09:02,320 --> 00:09:04,840
Our comrades in charge of logistics

185
00:09:05,240 --> 00:09:06,240
are also working very hard.

186
00:09:06,760 --> 00:09:07,760
They don't even have the time

187
00:09:07,760 --> 00:09:09,000
to attend our mobilization meeting.

188
00:09:09,840 --> 00:09:10,800
What are they busy with?

189
00:09:11,600 --> 00:09:14,520
Transporting equipment for everyone.

190
00:09:15,960 --> 00:09:17,000
After the meeting ends,

191
00:09:17,760 --> 00:09:19,160
everyone, on a squad basis,

192
00:09:19,920 --> 00:09:21,240
can go and collect your gear.

193
00:09:23,480 --> 00:09:24,800
I've been thinking about this,

194
00:09:25,880 --> 00:09:27,640
and the leaders really have their ways.

195
00:09:28,160 --> 00:09:31,000
Though you aren't in the training,

196
00:09:31,440 --> 00:09:33,800
you're the Logistics Support Team Leader.

197
00:09:34,440 --> 00:09:35,000
In short,

198
00:09:35,560 --> 00:09:37,800
it accounts for that flying kick of yours,

199
00:09:38,240 --> 00:09:39,720
and keeps you from missing out.

200
00:09:41,280 --> 00:09:43,080
It's basically a roundabout approach.

201
00:09:43,520 --> 00:09:44,640
Killing two birds with one stone, right?

202
00:09:45,320 --> 00:09:46,680
What roundabout approach?

203
00:09:47,120 --> 00:09:48,240
Stop saying things like that.

204
00:09:49,120 --> 00:09:49,800
Understood, understood.

205
00:09:50,360 --> 00:09:51,520
I'll keep a low profile.

206
00:10:01,240 --> 00:10:02,000
I'm telling you,

207
00:10:03,480 --> 00:10:05,360
The Army Commander and I at the Group Army

208
00:10:05,680 --> 00:10:07,080
have already made a military pledge.

209
00:10:07,880 --> 00:10:09,400
The two of you, one chief and one deputy,

210
00:10:10,080 --> 00:10:11,880
must ensure all tasks are carried out.

211
00:10:12,360 --> 00:10:12,800
Yes, sir!

212
00:10:13,240 --> 00:10:13,880
Please rest assured, Chief.

213
00:10:14,080 --> 00:10:15,560
We will do our absolute best.

214
00:10:17,840 --> 00:10:18,480
Comrade Jian'an,

215
00:10:18,760 --> 00:10:19,080
Here!

216
00:10:19,760 --> 00:10:21,720
You are an expert in military theory

217
00:10:22,120 --> 00:10:23,640
and a specialist in troop management.

218
00:10:24,200 --> 00:10:25,640
You must utilize your strengths.

219
00:10:26,200 --> 00:10:26,520
Yes, sir!

220
00:10:27,360 --> 00:10:29,000
I will not let you down, sir.

221
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:31,320
On the modern battlefield,

222
00:10:31,880 --> 00:10:34,160
New-Type Combat Forces frequently emerge.

223
00:10:34,920 --> 00:10:35,960
Only by speeding up our pace

224
00:10:36,720 --> 00:10:38,240
can we avoid being left behind.

225
00:10:38,880 --> 00:10:39,240
Yes, sir!

226
00:10:42,480 --> 00:10:42,840
Let's go.

227
00:10:54,160 --> 00:10:54,840
Salute.

228
00:10:57,360 --> 00:10:58,040
Zeng Muhan.

229
00:10:58,440 --> 00:10:58,840
Here!

230
00:11:03,320 --> 00:11:03,800
Next.

231
00:11:03,800 --> 00:11:06,240
Show me your officer ID and training pass.

232
00:11:13,760 --> 00:11:16,080
The name matches,

233
00:11:16,760 --> 00:11:18,000
but you don't look like the photo.

234
00:11:19,640 --> 00:11:20,320
Sir!

235
00:11:21,320 --> 00:11:22,280
Normally,

236
00:11:22,600 --> 00:11:23,920
a photo is just a two-dimensional display,

237
00:11:24,760 --> 00:11:25,960
while a real person is three-dimensional.

238
00:11:25,960 --> 00:11:26,680
All right, all right.

239
00:11:27,400 --> 00:11:28,040
Here.

240
00:11:28,840 --> 00:11:29,360
Go on,

241
00:11:29,720 --> 00:11:30,520
go get your things.

242
00:11:31,480 --> 00:11:32,680
Recon platoon equipment.

243
00:11:34,240 --> 00:11:35,880
Squad Leader Yang, Special Ops Team?

244
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:38,480
I'm Hong Xiafei.

245
00:11:38,480 --> 00:11:39,400
Next.

246
00:11:49,400 --> 00:11:50,640
Yang Mao...

247
00:11:51,960 --> 00:11:52,960
Yang Maolin.

248
00:11:56,040 --> 00:11:57,200
So you're Yang Maolin.

249
00:11:57,800 --> 00:11:58,560
That's me.

250
00:11:59,160 --> 00:12:00,640
You look pretty ordinary.

251
00:12:01,840 --> 00:12:02,520
Next.

252
00:12:07,720 --> 00:12:08,600
Squad Leader Hong.

253
00:12:09,080 --> 00:12:10,760
Squad Leader Hong is an old friend.

254
00:12:10,840 --> 00:12:11,600
No need to check.

255
00:12:11,960 --> 00:12:13,400
You people from the training base

256
00:12:13,400 --> 00:12:14,960
are also joining the training this time.

257
00:12:15,280 --> 00:12:16,640
Why wouldn't we be?

258
00:12:16,640 --> 00:12:18,320
This is a Theater Command Army pilot,

259
00:12:18,320 --> 00:12:19,880
not some private game of house.

260
00:12:20,560 --> 00:12:22,120
Are you trying to exclude people?

261
00:12:23,440 --> 00:12:24,360
What are you talking about?

262
00:12:24,560 --> 00:12:25,400
How could we?

263
00:12:25,720 --> 00:12:27,200
Squad Leader Hong, what do you need?

264
00:12:27,720 --> 00:12:28,360
Electronic warfare.

265
00:12:28,520 --> 00:12:29,240
Electronic warfare?

266
00:12:29,440 --> 00:12:30,960
Why switch to electronic warfare?

267
00:12:31,080 --> 00:12:32,080
Company Commander Li.

268
00:12:32,200 --> 00:12:33,840
Are you running a background check on me?

269
00:12:34,480 --> 00:12:36,400
Though I usually work as an adjudicator,

270
00:12:36,440 --> 00:12:37,560
my primary specialty

271
00:12:37,560 --> 00:12:38,760
is communications and electronic warfare.

272
00:12:39,760 --> 00:12:40,640
Besides,

273
00:12:40,640 --> 00:12:42,640
do I need your approval for everything?

274
00:12:42,760 --> 00:12:43,480
No, you don't.

275
00:12:43,640 --> 00:12:44,880
I'm just...

276
00:12:45,080 --> 00:12:46,120
a bit confused.

277
00:12:46,640 --> 00:12:47,360
Here, Squad Leader Hong.

278
00:12:47,720 --> 00:12:48,280
Go get it over there.

279
00:12:49,160 --> 00:12:50,200
Electronic warfare equipment.

280
00:12:54,440 --> 00:12:55,400
Come on, next.

281
00:12:57,800 --> 00:12:59,840
These devices are highly sophisticated.

282
00:12:59,840 --> 00:13:01,160
Make sure to handle them with care.

283
00:13:01,280 --> 00:13:02,080
Yes, sir.

284
00:13:06,760 --> 00:13:07,000
Guo...

285
00:13:07,880 --> 00:13:08,800
Battalion Commander Guo.

286
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:09,680
Squad Leader Hong.

287
00:13:10,280 --> 00:13:12,040
Why are you here?

288
00:13:12,640 --> 00:13:14,920
This is the 396th Brigade Training Unit.

289
00:13:15,120 --> 00:13:16,640
I'm an instructor for the Training Unit.

290
00:13:16,640 --> 00:13:17,880
If I'm not here, where else would I be?

291
00:13:18,080 --> 00:13:19,280
Right, right, right.

292
00:13:19,440 --> 00:13:20,640
Hold that equipment securely.

293
00:13:20,640 --> 00:13:21,560
Handle it with care.

294
00:13:21,840 --> 00:13:23,640
Battalion Commander Guo, I'll get going.

295
00:13:24,120 --> 00:13:24,400
Okay.

296
00:13:24,640 --> 00:13:24,960
Goodbye.

297
00:13:24,960 --> 00:13:25,480
Goodbye, Battalion Commander Guo.

298
00:13:31,560 --> 00:13:32,040
Commander.

299
00:13:32,640 --> 00:13:33,960
Everything meets its match.

300
00:13:34,160 --> 00:13:35,440
You had quite the presence just now.

301
00:13:35,760 --> 00:13:36,520
Squad Leader Hong was like,

302
00:13:37,320 --> 00:13:37,840
"Battalion Commander Guo,

303
00:13:38,040 --> 00:13:38,400
goodbye."

304
00:13:38,720 --> 00:13:40,080
Quit messing around.

305
00:13:40,680 --> 00:13:42,040
Register them quickly, people are waiting.

306
00:13:42,240 --> 00:13:42,800
Next!

307
00:13:42,800 --> 00:13:43,120
Right.

308
00:13:43,440 --> 00:13:44,080
Next.

309
00:13:47,280 --> 00:13:48,240
Staff Officer Liang,

310
00:13:48,600 --> 00:13:50,080
guess who I saw.

311
00:13:51,760 --> 00:13:52,560
Guo Zijian.

312
00:13:53,000 --> 00:13:54,200
How did you know?

313
00:13:54,600 --> 00:13:56,280
It's written all over your face.

314
00:13:57,120 --> 00:13:58,600
Is it that obvious?

315
00:13:59,120 --> 00:14:00,080
But did you know?

316
00:14:00,160 --> 00:14:02,320
He's issuing gear in Logistics Support.

317
00:14:02,680 --> 00:14:04,200
Isn't that a huge waste of his talents?

318
00:14:05,800 --> 00:14:07,480
As long as he's in the training team,

319
00:14:07,480 --> 00:14:08,520
regardless of his position,

320
00:14:08,520 --> 00:14:10,240
having a place means he has a chance.

321
00:14:17,120 --> 00:14:17,720
Staff Officer Liang.

322
00:14:18,400 --> 00:14:19,000
Staff Officer Liang!

323
00:14:21,800 --> 00:14:22,400
Are you busy?

324
00:14:22,560 --> 00:14:23,400
If you're not,

325
00:14:23,440 --> 00:14:25,000
I have something to ask you.

326
00:14:25,160 --> 00:14:26,400
Section Chief Liu, no need to be formal.

327
00:14:26,440 --> 00:14:27,040
Go ahead.

328
00:14:27,880 --> 00:14:30,040
It's about the end of the last drill.

329
00:14:30,200 --> 00:14:31,600
When Guo Zijian

330
00:14:31,880 --> 00:14:33,880
led Yang Maolin's decapitation strike.

331
00:14:34,440 --> 00:14:35,280
In the end,

332
00:14:35,280 --> 00:14:37,440
were you two the only ones at the scene?

333
00:14:38,920 --> 00:14:40,440
Yes. Is there a problem?

334
00:14:40,480 --> 00:14:42,320
Well, someone reported

335
00:14:42,600 --> 00:14:45,400
Guo Zijian deliberately stalled for time,

336
00:14:45,400 --> 00:14:46,960
letting Long Yuanshan off the hook.

337
00:14:47,040 --> 00:14:48,840
I don't know if that's true,

338
00:14:48,840 --> 00:14:50,880
so I wanted to ask you about it.

339
00:14:51,440 --> 00:14:52,960
Deliberately stalled for time?

340
00:14:53,800 --> 00:14:55,600
Why would anyone think that?

341
00:14:56,280 --> 00:14:58,120
Have they lost their minds?

342
00:14:59,960 --> 00:15:01,440
As for such claims,

343
00:15:01,920 --> 00:15:04,040
it's better to ask the person involved.

344
00:15:04,040 --> 00:15:05,240
As adjudicators,

345
00:15:05,240 --> 00:15:07,360
we only observe and record the facts.

346
00:15:07,720 --> 00:15:09,760
As for all sorts of speculations or

347
00:15:09,840 --> 00:15:10,920
psychological intentions,

348
00:15:10,920 --> 00:15:12,440
we have no way to judge them.

349
00:15:14,120 --> 00:15:15,080
That makes sense.

350
00:15:15,320 --> 00:15:15,840
Alright.

351
00:15:16,160 --> 00:15:17,240
With an answer like that,

352
00:15:17,240 --> 00:15:18,040
thank you very much.

353
00:15:18,440 --> 00:15:19,200
I'll get back to work.

354
00:15:23,480 --> 00:15:24,160
Staff Officer Liang!

355
00:15:24,520 --> 00:15:27,000
Section Chief Liu is always so paranoid.

356
00:15:28,400 --> 00:15:29,360
Baffling.

357
00:15:30,840 --> 00:15:32,800
Hurry up, stop dawdling!

358
00:15:33,240 --> 00:15:34,800
The soldiers are waiting to eat.

359
00:15:37,560 --> 00:15:39,600
Solid Logistics Support Team Leader work.

360
00:15:39,880 --> 00:15:40,520
Of course.

361
00:15:41,360 --> 00:15:42,640
You own whatever you're doing.

362
00:15:42,640 --> 00:15:43,960
You pitch whatever you're selling.

363
00:15:44,840 --> 00:15:45,960
Then let me ask you,

364
00:15:46,760 --> 00:15:48,560
if someone acts one way to your face

365
00:15:48,680 --> 00:15:49,760
and another way behind your back,

366
00:15:49,760 --> 00:15:50,720
how do you pitch

367
00:15:50,920 --> 00:15:51,840
something like that?

368
00:15:52,760 --> 00:15:53,600
What do you mean?

369
00:15:53,800 --> 00:15:54,720
I don't follow.

370
00:15:54,880 --> 00:15:55,840
Bad memory?

371
00:15:56,040 --> 00:15:57,880
Forgot what you just did?

372
00:15:57,920 --> 00:15:59,240
I've done a lot of things.

373
00:15:59,960 --> 00:16:01,800
Unloaded and issued gear this morning.

374
00:16:01,920 --> 00:16:03,360
And there's a pile of vegetables up there.

375
00:16:03,440 --> 00:16:04,240
If you're so free,

376
00:16:04,480 --> 00:16:05,560
want to lend a hand?

377
00:16:05,560 --> 00:16:06,680
Don't play games with me.

378
00:16:07,200 --> 00:16:09,520
What's done in the dark comes to light.

379
00:16:09,520 --> 00:16:09,960
Let me ask you,

380
00:16:12,240 --> 00:16:13,600
during the last exercise,

381
00:16:14,080 --> 00:16:16,320
did you let Long Yuanshan off on purpose?

382
00:16:17,200 --> 00:16:17,880
I'm not afraid to tell you,

383
00:16:18,520 --> 00:16:19,840
I found the evidence.

384
00:16:20,280 --> 00:16:21,080
Is that so?

385
00:16:21,440 --> 00:16:22,680
Then you've earned a merit.

386
00:16:22,920 --> 00:16:24,400
Go report to the superiors now.

387
00:16:25,200 --> 00:16:25,840
Guo Zijian,

388
00:16:27,080 --> 00:16:27,840
you can't expect

389
00:16:28,120 --> 00:16:29,840
to cover this up.

390
00:16:31,560 --> 00:16:33,200
The higher-ups aren't fools.

391
00:16:33,880 --> 00:16:35,400
You think running to the training team

392
00:16:35,400 --> 00:16:36,720
to be the Logistics Support Team Leader

393
00:16:37,280 --> 00:16:38,680
means you can get away with it?

394
00:16:38,920 --> 00:16:41,120
The rice pot incident isn't over yet.

395
00:16:41,560 --> 00:16:43,040
Add this to the list,

396
00:16:43,080 --> 00:16:44,040
you'll be punished for both.

397
00:16:44,040 --> 00:16:45,280
You'll be in for

398
00:16:45,280 --> 00:16:46,360
a world of trouble.

399
00:16:49,880 --> 00:16:50,640
Liu Wangyuan.

400
00:16:51,360 --> 00:16:53,680
I can't be bothered with people like you.

401
00:16:54,280 --> 00:16:55,840
If this were two years ago,

402
00:16:56,360 --> 00:16:57,760
do you know what I'd do to you?

403
00:16:59,880 --> 00:17:00,560
What are you going to do?

404
00:17:00,880 --> 00:17:01,920
You want to hit me?

405
00:17:02,800 --> 00:17:03,680
You're nothing.

406
00:17:04,240 --> 00:17:05,119
Speed it up!

407
00:17:05,480 --> 00:17:07,000
Don't delay Section Chief Liu's meal.

408
00:17:07,040 --> 00:17:07,520
Yes, sir!

409
00:17:08,920 --> 00:17:10,400
You're the one who's nothing!

410
00:17:13,119 --> 00:17:14,359
What are you looking at?

411
00:17:14,760 --> 00:17:15,280
Get to work!

412
00:17:34,080 --> 00:17:34,880
Comrade.

413
00:17:35,240 --> 00:17:36,400
Don't waste food.

414
00:17:43,880 --> 00:17:44,840
I'm talking to you.

415
00:17:47,640 --> 00:17:49,120
Squad Leader Wu wants a word with you.

416
00:17:53,560 --> 00:17:54,320
About what?

417
00:17:57,800 --> 00:17:59,000
Tonight at 2100.

418
00:17:59,560 --> 00:18:01,000
At the PT field.

419
00:18:02,040 --> 00:18:02,840
He'll be waiting.

420
00:18:29,080 --> 00:18:29,800
Yang Maolin.

421
00:18:31,200 --> 00:18:32,520
Meet me at the gate after you eat.

422
00:18:32,840 --> 00:18:33,280
Yes, sir.

423
00:18:38,120 --> 00:18:38,920
Wangyuan,

424
00:18:39,480 --> 00:18:41,240
you're Chief of the Operations and Training Section.

425
00:18:41,560 --> 00:18:44,320
This event may be a Group Army project,

426
00:18:44,720 --> 00:18:45,520
but

427
00:18:46,160 --> 00:18:48,120
the team leader is the Operations Director.

428
00:18:48,200 --> 00:18:49,040
You cannot slack off.

429
00:18:49,120 --> 00:18:50,920
Of course. It's my duty, after all.

430
00:18:52,520 --> 00:18:53,280
Tonight,

431
00:18:53,400 --> 00:18:55,600
inspect the training grounds thoroughly.

432
00:18:55,840 --> 00:18:57,120
See if anything needs to be improved.

433
00:18:57,840 --> 00:19:00,040
The Group Army is training here.

434
00:19:00,160 --> 00:19:02,360
We must ensure solid logistics support.

435
00:19:02,680 --> 00:19:05,520
Then I'm doing Guo Zijian's job.

436
00:19:05,760 --> 00:19:07,080
He's the Logistics Support Team Leader.

437
00:19:07,240 --> 00:19:08,640
Don't be so petty.

438
00:19:08,640 --> 00:19:10,160
It's all part of our job.

439
00:19:10,480 --> 00:19:11,160
Don't forget.

440
00:19:11,680 --> 00:19:12,720
Alright.

441
00:19:16,280 --> 00:19:17,520
Why is Lin Yihu looking for you?

442
00:19:17,680 --> 00:19:19,760
He said Squad Leader Wu sent a message.

443
00:19:19,880 --> 00:19:22,480
To meet him at the PT field at 9 PM.

444
00:19:22,800 --> 00:19:23,920
And you believe that?

445
00:19:24,120 --> 00:19:25,120
Are you stupid?

446
00:19:25,240 --> 00:19:26,560
He's looking for trouble.

447
00:19:26,560 --> 00:19:27,480
Can't you see that?

448
00:19:27,840 --> 00:19:29,080
Why would he want to cause me trouble?

449
00:19:29,080 --> 00:19:30,480
Are you dense?

450
00:19:32,440 --> 00:19:33,920
Because of the Squad Leader Wu incident.

451
00:19:33,920 --> 00:19:34,840
Look at his attitude toward you.

452
00:19:34,840 --> 00:19:35,920
Can't you see it?

453
00:19:39,160 --> 00:19:40,640
Don't you have a training class tonight?

454
00:19:43,160 --> 00:19:44,400
I was just worrying about that.

455
00:19:44,640 --> 00:19:45,840
You go to your training.

456
00:19:45,960 --> 00:19:46,760
I'll go in your place.

457
00:19:47,200 --> 00:19:47,880
You will?

458
00:19:47,880 --> 00:19:48,360
What?

459
00:19:48,760 --> 00:19:50,320
You think I can't handle these punks?

460
00:19:51,800 --> 00:19:52,520
Go on.

461
00:19:53,640 --> 00:19:54,120
Yes.

462
00:20:02,760 --> 00:20:03,600
Remember this later, guys.

463
00:20:03,640 --> 00:20:05,160
We can't actually beat Yang Maolin up.

464
00:20:05,360 --> 00:20:07,400
We're just teaching him a lesson. Hear me?

465
00:20:07,400 --> 00:20:08,360
Don't worry.

466
00:20:10,840 --> 00:20:12,120
Alright, alright, alright.

467
00:20:12,640 --> 00:20:13,400
Here he comes, here he comes.

468
00:20:13,400 --> 00:20:15,840
Who knows what Captain Wang is thinking.

469
00:20:16,400 --> 00:20:18,520
Pitch black, and no light set up.

470
00:20:30,360 --> 00:20:31,000
Who is it?

471
00:20:32,840 --> 00:20:33,560
Who is it?

472
00:20:33,960 --> 00:20:34,680
Who is it?

473
00:20:35,480 --> 00:20:36,080
Who is it?

474
00:20:37,880 --> 00:20:38,720
Who is it?

475
00:20:40,240 --> 00:20:41,360
These little brats.

476
00:20:41,400 --> 00:20:42,880
I swear I'll catch you!

477
00:21:02,360 --> 00:21:04,600
I'll try to hold the fort initially.

478
00:21:04,880 --> 00:21:07,440
But once the training gets on track,

479
00:21:08,520 --> 00:21:11,040
I'll need you to step up, Old Suo.

480
00:21:11,160 --> 00:21:12,520
Of course.

481
00:21:14,440 --> 00:21:16,800
Operations is the Group Army's largest.

482
00:21:17,000 --> 00:21:18,120
I know you're busy.

483
00:21:19,040 --> 00:21:19,960
If anything comes up,

484
00:21:20,200 --> 00:21:21,000
just leave it to me.

485
00:21:21,480 --> 00:21:23,880
Right now is the training prep phase.

486
00:21:24,120 --> 00:21:25,600
I have plenty of time.

487
00:21:25,960 --> 00:21:27,200
Then thanks for your support.

488
00:21:29,920 --> 00:21:31,240
Chief.

489
00:21:32,640 --> 00:21:34,640
This... This Guo Zijian.

490
00:21:34,640 --> 00:21:36,520
He's completely out of line!

491
00:21:45,800 --> 00:21:46,920
Crap, crap.

492
00:21:47,000 --> 00:21:49,040
We were just meant to scare Yang Maolin,

493
00:21:49,160 --> 00:21:50,720
but we bagged Scheming Liu instead.

494
00:21:50,720 --> 00:21:51,520
Tell me,

495
00:21:51,600 --> 00:21:53,240
if he reports us for officer assault,

496
00:21:53,400 --> 00:21:54,120
what are we gonna do?

497
00:21:54,120 --> 00:21:55,000
Don't talk nonsense.

498
00:21:55,360 --> 00:21:56,480
That wasn't an assault.

499
00:21:56,560 --> 00:21:57,640
It was a prank at most.

500
00:21:57,880 --> 00:21:59,600
You know how much he values his pride.

501
00:21:59,640 --> 00:22:00,400
He won't just swallow this.

502
00:22:01,160 --> 00:22:01,920
Tell me,

503
00:22:02,680 --> 00:22:03,480
what should we do?

504
00:22:04,520 --> 00:22:05,640
About what happened today,

505
00:22:06,320 --> 00:22:07,600
everyone keep your mouths shut tight.

506
00:22:07,680 --> 00:22:08,800
If anyone leaks a word,

507
00:22:08,880 --> 00:22:10,200
all four of us will go down together.

508
00:22:10,200 --> 00:22:11,640
We'll all get kicked out and sent packing.

509
00:22:12,120 --> 00:22:13,600
If word gets out about this,

510
00:22:13,600 --> 00:22:14,920
it'd be too humiliating.

511
00:22:14,920 --> 00:22:16,320
We must keep this to ourselves.

512
00:22:16,400 --> 00:22:17,640
He doesn't know it was us anyway,

513
00:22:17,680 --> 00:22:18,200
right?

514
00:22:18,200 --> 00:22:18,680
Right.

515
00:22:20,000 --> 00:22:20,920
How about

516
00:22:21,480 --> 00:22:22,400
we just wash up and go to sleep?

517
00:22:22,400 --> 00:22:23,680
No, it's too early.

518
00:22:24,720 --> 00:22:26,000
Then what should we do?

519
00:22:26,800 --> 00:22:27,560
Let's go.

520
00:22:28,120 --> 00:22:29,880
Let's practice boxing by headquarters.

521
00:22:29,880 --> 00:22:30,640
It's the brightest there.

522
00:22:30,640 --> 00:22:31,560
We need to make sure they see us.

523
00:22:31,640 --> 00:22:32,800
Right, right, right.

524
00:22:32,800 --> 00:22:33,600
Let's go, let's go.

525
00:22:33,600 --> 00:22:34,480
Go, go, go.

526
00:22:36,520 --> 00:22:37,120
Let's go.

527
00:22:37,640 --> 00:22:39,680
Capture drills, combat stance!

528
00:22:39,680 --> 00:22:40,400
Kill!

529
00:22:41,520 --> 00:22:42,160
Movement one!

530
00:22:42,720 --> 00:22:43,640
Kill!

531
00:22:43,800 --> 00:22:44,480
Movement two!

532
00:22:45,200 --> 00:22:45,920
Kill!

533
00:22:46,200 --> 00:22:46,800
Where are they?

534
00:22:46,800 --> 00:22:47,520
Kill!

535
00:22:47,680 --> 00:22:48,160
Over here.

536
00:22:48,240 --> 00:22:49,120
Movement three!

537
00:22:49,800 --> 00:22:50,720
Kill!

538
00:22:51,160 --> 00:22:52,040
Movement four!

539
00:22:52,880 --> 00:22:53,680
Kill!

540
00:22:54,640 --> 00:22:55,040
Kill!

541
00:22:55,040 --> 00:22:55,640
The training ground?

542
00:22:55,640 --> 00:22:56,160
Yes.

543
00:22:59,200 --> 00:23:00,360
Why are they heading to the training ground?

544
00:23:00,960 --> 00:23:02,040
It's fine, don't panic.

545
00:23:02,040 --> 00:23:02,840
They weren't asking us.

546
00:23:03,520 --> 00:23:04,240
Keep practicing.

547
00:23:04,680 --> 00:23:05,120
Okay.

548
00:23:14,720 --> 00:23:16,000
These brats...

549
00:23:16,640 --> 00:23:18,000
They can't even pick a fight on time.

550
00:23:34,400 --> 00:23:35,160
Where?

551
00:23:35,720 --> 00:23:36,840
Just up ahead.

552
00:23:45,520 --> 00:23:46,960
Right around these sandbags.

553
00:23:46,960 --> 00:23:48,920
And then I got pushed into this pit.

554
00:23:49,240 --> 00:23:50,120
This one.

555
00:23:57,560 --> 00:23:58,240
Who's there?

556
00:24:01,040 --> 00:24:02,120
It's me, Guo Zijian.

557
00:24:04,840 --> 00:24:05,960
Guo Zijian?

558
00:24:07,680 --> 00:24:08,640
It's so late,

559
00:24:08,960 --> 00:24:09,560
what are you doing?

560
00:24:10,480 --> 00:24:11,280
Director.

561
00:24:11,680 --> 00:24:12,560
What are you doing here?

562
00:24:12,600 --> 00:24:13,480
What are we doing here?

563
00:24:13,520 --> 00:24:14,520
You have the nerve to ask?

564
00:24:14,600 --> 00:24:16,120
Was that you just now, Guo Zijian?

565
00:24:16,880 --> 00:24:18,160
I bet you didn't expect

566
00:24:18,160 --> 00:24:19,600
that I'd come right back, did you?

567
00:24:19,800 --> 00:24:21,160
Come right back?

568
00:24:21,760 --> 00:24:23,240
Lost your mind, Section Chief Liu?

569
00:24:23,240 --> 00:24:24,640
Stop interrupting! I'm asking you,

570
00:24:26,400 --> 00:24:28,120
what are you doing here this late?

571
00:24:30,840 --> 00:24:31,480
Sir!

572
00:24:31,760 --> 00:24:33,680
I'm here to resolve an internal conflict.

573
00:24:33,840 --> 00:24:35,280
Sirs, listen to him!

574
00:24:36,120 --> 00:24:38,440
Is this how you solve internal conflicts?

575
00:24:38,680 --> 00:24:39,880
I mean, Guo Zijian,

576
00:24:40,320 --> 00:24:42,160
this is an egregious offense!

577
00:24:42,280 --> 00:24:43,560
This is a very serious problem.

578
00:24:43,560 --> 00:24:44,040
Alright.

579
00:24:44,680 --> 00:24:45,560
Let's not discuss this here.

580
00:24:46,040 --> 00:24:47,720
Back to the office. We'll talk there.

581
00:24:48,520 --> 00:24:49,560
Come, come here.

582
00:24:55,000 --> 00:24:55,840
Kill!

583
00:24:56,240 --> 00:24:56,960
Movement one!

584
00:24:58,000 --> 00:24:58,560
Kill!

585
00:24:59,080 --> 00:24:59,720
Movement two!

586
00:25:00,480 --> 00:25:00,920
Kill!

587
00:25:00,920 --> 00:25:01,840
What's wrong? You look half-dead.

588
00:25:01,840 --> 00:25:02,440
Movement three!

589
00:25:03,400 --> 00:25:04,160
Kill!

590
00:25:04,640 --> 00:25:05,360
Movement four!

591
00:25:06,560 --> 00:25:07,280
Kill!

592
00:25:07,280 --> 00:25:08,000
You soldiers over there,

593
00:25:09,440 --> 00:25:10,800
what are you doing so late?

594
00:25:11,160 --> 00:25:12,120
Sir!

595
00:25:12,240 --> 00:25:13,080
It's bright here,

596
00:25:13,240 --> 00:25:14,280
so we're practicing a bit.

597
00:25:14,280 --> 00:25:15,040
Alright.

598
00:25:15,360 --> 00:25:16,160
Get some rest early.

599
00:25:16,400 --> 00:25:17,280
Yes, sir.

600
00:25:18,280 --> 00:25:19,560
What are you looking at?

601
00:25:19,680 --> 00:25:20,680
Let's go.

602
00:25:21,640 --> 00:25:22,880
I think you really need to practice.

603
00:25:26,840 --> 00:25:27,960
Oh no, oh no.

604
00:25:28,160 --> 00:25:29,200
This has blown up.

605
00:25:29,560 --> 00:25:31,040
They even called our battalion commander in.

606
00:25:31,040 --> 00:25:31,960
Stop talking nonsense.

607
00:25:32,200 --> 00:25:33,040
Right now, there's no evidence,

608
00:25:33,040 --> 00:25:34,240
so no one can do anything to us.

609
00:25:34,640 --> 00:25:35,440
Besides,

610
00:25:35,840 --> 00:25:37,120
the commanders just saw us.

611
00:25:37,360 --> 00:25:38,880
They'd never suspect us.

612
00:25:39,960 --> 00:25:40,560
Yeah.

613
00:25:41,240 --> 00:25:43,400
No evidence, no crime.

614
00:25:43,480 --> 00:25:44,360
As long as they don't have proof,

615
00:25:44,480 --> 00:25:45,560
they can't catch us.

616
00:25:45,560 --> 00:25:46,320
That's right.

617
00:25:46,320 --> 00:25:47,640
Come on, let's keep practicing, guys.

618
00:25:48,960 --> 00:25:50,040
Sirs,

619
00:25:50,120 --> 00:25:51,760
you have to get justice for me.

620
00:25:52,080 --> 00:25:53,600
Not only did he put a sack over me,

621
00:25:53,600 --> 00:25:55,280
he put sand inside it.

622
00:25:55,400 --> 00:25:56,920
Look at how red my eyes are.

623
00:25:57,040 --> 00:25:58,320
I'm almost blind!

624
00:25:58,640 --> 00:25:59,640
Section Chief Liu,

625
00:25:59,920 --> 00:26:01,440
you need proof for your claims.

626
00:26:01,800 --> 00:26:03,840
That sack covered your whole head,

627
00:26:03,840 --> 00:26:05,080
so how could you see it was me?

628
00:26:05,080 --> 00:26:05,680
Do you have X-ray vision?

629
00:26:05,680 --> 00:26:07,160
Stop being so stubborn!

630
00:26:07,280 --> 00:26:08,440
You know exactly what you did.

631
00:26:08,440 --> 00:26:09,800
Stop playing dumb!

632
00:26:12,080 --> 00:26:12,720
That's right.

633
00:26:15,200 --> 00:26:16,120
Exactly.

634
00:26:16,200 --> 00:26:17,840
That stinky sweat smell on him,

635
00:26:17,840 --> 00:26:19,720
I could smell it even blindfolded!

636
00:26:20,040 --> 00:26:21,200
So not only do you have X-ray vision,

637
00:26:21,360 --> 00:26:22,920
you also have the skills of an army dog.

638
00:26:22,920 --> 00:26:23,920
You!

639
00:26:24,560 --> 00:26:25,560
Sir!

640
00:26:25,560 --> 00:26:26,560
He just called me a dog!

641
00:26:26,560 --> 00:26:28,080
Enough about the dog.

642
00:26:28,240 --> 00:26:29,400
Let's talk about the human matters.

643
00:26:33,360 --> 00:26:35,000
Then how do you explain the dirt on your boots?

644
00:26:38,040 --> 00:26:39,560
The dirt on my boots

645
00:26:39,640 --> 00:26:40,400
is because I saw

646
00:26:40,400 --> 00:26:42,640
the training ground's sandbag wall fell,

647
00:26:42,640 --> 00:26:43,640
so I stacked it back up.

648
00:26:43,640 --> 00:26:44,560
Excuses!

649
00:26:44,920 --> 00:26:45,440
Guo Zijian,

650
00:26:46,800 --> 00:26:47,800
tell the truth.

651
00:26:48,400 --> 00:26:49,880
Did you assault Chief Liu or not?

652
00:26:50,200 --> 00:26:52,000
Sir, I did not.

653
00:26:52,000 --> 00:26:53,440
The evidence is solid.

654
00:26:53,440 --> 00:26:55,040
And you still refuse to admit it?

655
00:26:56,120 --> 00:26:56,960
Director.

656
00:26:57,320 --> 00:26:59,800
What's my reputation in the 396th Brigade?

657
00:26:59,800 --> 00:27:00,920
If you don't know,

658
00:27:00,920 --> 00:27:02,120
you can ask around.

659
00:27:02,120 --> 00:27:05,240
For years, from superiors to subordinates,

660
00:27:05,440 --> 00:27:07,080
I haven't had a conflict with anyone.

661
00:27:07,080 --> 00:27:08,120
Moreover, everyone treats me

662
00:27:08,120 --> 00:27:10,400
with respect and like a brother.

663
00:27:10,400 --> 00:27:11,800
There's no one who doesn't like me.

664
00:27:13,040 --> 00:27:14,040
How come before,

665
00:27:14,040 --> 00:27:15,920
our brigade never had such incidents?

666
00:27:16,000 --> 00:27:17,720
But the moment Guo Zijian arrives,

667
00:27:17,720 --> 00:27:19,640
such a vicious incident occurs?

668
00:27:19,760 --> 00:27:20,600
Why?

669
00:27:21,560 --> 00:27:24,080
It's because he's never liked me.

670
00:27:24,080 --> 00:27:25,280
He has a problem with me.

671
00:27:26,040 --> 00:27:27,000
Guo Zijian,

672
00:27:27,000 --> 00:27:29,320
if you have a problem with me, say it to my face.

673
00:27:29,480 --> 00:27:30,200
I, Liu Wangyuan,

674
00:27:30,200 --> 00:27:32,040
am not someone who can't take criticism.

675
00:27:32,240 --> 00:27:34,760
If you really want to get physical,

676
00:27:34,840 --> 00:27:37,440
we can have a face-to-face match.

677
00:27:37,480 --> 00:27:39,080
It's anyone's guess who'd win.

678
00:27:41,360 --> 00:27:42,480
You're laughing?

679
00:27:42,760 --> 00:27:44,560
Commander, look at his attitude.

680
00:27:45,040 --> 00:27:46,200
Chief Liu,

681
00:27:46,800 --> 00:27:48,040
you've got it backwards.

682
00:27:48,240 --> 00:27:50,640
You're the one with a problem with me.

683
00:27:50,720 --> 00:27:52,320
Always staying on my case.

684
00:27:53,320 --> 00:27:55,200
I admit I don't really like you.

685
00:27:55,640 --> 00:27:57,240
But I'm not stupid enough

686
00:27:57,240 --> 00:27:58,600
to ambush you in the dark.

687
00:27:59,240 --> 00:28:00,120
You hear that?

688
00:28:00,320 --> 00:28:01,960
He admitted he doesn't like me!

689
00:28:02,640 --> 00:28:04,480
Right, you aren't stupid.

690
00:28:04,480 --> 00:28:05,600
You're so sneaky.

691
00:28:05,960 --> 00:28:08,760
Last exercise, you let Long Yuanshan off.

692
00:28:08,800 --> 00:28:10,440
Wasn't that just quid pro quo

693
00:28:10,480 --> 00:28:11,600
to get into the 404th Brigade?

694
00:28:11,800 --> 00:28:13,320
But think about it,

695
00:28:13,480 --> 00:28:16,280
with your habit of kicking over pots,

696
00:28:16,360 --> 00:28:17,400
would they even want you?

697
00:28:17,400 --> 00:28:19,680
Only our brigade's leaders are so lenient.

698
00:28:19,760 --> 00:28:20,840
Enough.

699
00:28:21,400 --> 00:28:24,000
You're pretty good at sowing discord too.

700
00:28:24,480 --> 00:28:25,840
That's a separate matter.

701
00:28:25,840 --> 00:28:26,960
Kicking the pot and hitting you

702
00:28:27,200 --> 00:28:28,920
are two completely unrelated things.

703
00:28:29,040 --> 00:28:29,920
Besides,

704
00:28:29,920 --> 00:28:32,400
I never wanted to join the 404th Brigade.

705
00:28:32,600 --> 00:28:35,040
You know very well if you thought about it.

706
00:28:35,360 --> 00:28:36,840
But then again,

707
00:28:37,200 --> 00:28:39,520
if you can lose your temper and kick someone's pot,

708
00:28:39,720 --> 00:28:41,760
couldn't you snap and ambush me?

709
00:28:41,760 --> 00:28:43,080
Just stick to the facts.

710
00:28:43,080 --> 00:28:44,480
Why bring up unrelated things?

711
00:28:44,480 --> 00:28:46,320
They're practically the same thing!

712
00:28:46,320 --> 00:28:47,040
Alright, that's enough.

713
00:28:51,560 --> 00:28:52,520
Guo Zijian.

714
00:28:53,440 --> 00:28:55,200
You are a soldier.

715
00:28:56,320 --> 00:28:57,640
A veteran.

716
00:28:58,560 --> 00:29:00,040
A battalion commander now.

717
00:29:00,600 --> 00:29:02,480
Don't you know military regulations?

718
00:29:03,280 --> 00:29:05,040
What the consequences of this are,

719
00:29:05,440 --> 00:29:06,720
don't you understand?

720
00:29:06,800 --> 00:29:08,320
No, I really didn't hit him.

721
00:29:11,440 --> 00:29:12,240
Besides,

722
00:29:12,240 --> 00:29:14,120
how would I know he'd go to the training ground?

723
00:29:14,200 --> 00:29:16,280
I knew you'd use that excuse.

724
00:29:16,840 --> 00:29:18,720
Today at noon, outside the cafeteria,

725
00:29:19,080 --> 00:29:20,240
when Deputy Brigade Commander Suo told me

726
00:29:20,240 --> 00:29:21,680
to inspect the training ground tonight...

727
00:29:21,680 --> 00:29:22,280
Where were you?

728
00:29:22,520 --> 00:29:24,160
Weren't you right there?

729
00:29:24,280 --> 00:29:25,280
Did you think I didn't see you?

730
00:29:26,440 --> 00:29:27,880
But I never imagined,

731
00:29:27,880 --> 00:29:28,520
Guo Zijian,

732
00:29:28,520 --> 00:29:30,880
that you hated me this much.

733
00:29:30,960 --> 00:29:32,440
You couldn't hold back for a second, could you?

734
00:29:32,440 --> 00:29:34,240
You just threatened me this morning,

735
00:29:34,240 --> 00:29:35,720
and came after me tonight.

736
00:29:37,000 --> 00:29:38,280
Why on earth would you do that?

737
00:29:39,240 --> 00:29:40,240
Commanders,

738
00:29:40,560 --> 00:29:42,280
from the moment I was hit until now,

739
00:29:42,280 --> 00:29:44,320
I've been thinking about this too.

740
00:29:44,320 --> 00:29:44,920
Really.

741
00:29:45,200 --> 00:29:46,640
But after thinking it over,

742
00:29:46,640 --> 00:29:48,960
I could only come up with one possibility.

743
00:29:49,040 --> 00:29:50,840
He's afraid I'll expose him.

744
00:29:51,040 --> 00:29:52,160
Guo Zijian!

745
00:29:52,160 --> 00:29:53,880
You have a guilty conscience!

746
00:29:53,960 --> 00:29:56,280
If you insist on framing me, I have nothing to say.

747
00:29:56,360 --> 00:29:58,040
Having nothing to say isn't an option.

748
00:29:58,720 --> 00:30:00,000
You have to speak up.

749
00:30:02,720 --> 00:30:04,080
Reporting to Deputy Brigade Commander Suo.

750
00:30:04,560 --> 00:30:05,480
First of all,

751
00:30:05,840 --> 00:30:07,880
I never threatened Section Chief Liu.

752
00:30:08,400 --> 00:30:10,120
Even if we had a verbal conflict,

753
00:30:10,200 --> 00:30:11,920
it doesn't mean I had to hit him.

754
00:30:12,320 --> 00:30:14,240
There's no direct connection between the two.

755
00:30:14,640 --> 00:30:15,240
Second,

756
00:30:15,560 --> 00:30:16,960
this morning at the cafeteria,

757
00:30:17,320 --> 00:30:19,760
when assigning Section Chief Liu the task,

758
00:30:19,800 --> 00:30:20,960
I was indeed present.

759
00:30:21,600 --> 00:30:23,040
But I didn't hear

760
00:30:23,040 --> 00:30:24,360
what you were talking about.

761
00:30:25,520 --> 00:30:26,600
And about this dirt...

762
00:30:26,600 --> 00:30:27,960
I just explained it.

763
00:30:28,520 --> 00:30:30,640
The reason I went to the training ground was because...

764
00:30:32,200 --> 00:30:33,160
Because of what?

765
00:30:33,720 --> 00:30:34,840
I'm talking to you.

766
00:30:39,360 --> 00:30:40,960
Squad Leader Wu has something to say to you.

767
00:30:41,280 --> 00:30:42,440
What did Lin Yihu want with you?

768
00:30:42,920 --> 00:30:44,920
He said Squad Leader Wu asked him to pass a message,

769
00:30:45,040 --> 00:30:47,560
to meet him at the PT field at 9 PM.

770
00:30:47,560 --> 00:30:48,640
Are you stupid?

771
00:30:48,720 --> 00:30:50,000
He's looking for trouble.

772
00:30:50,000 --> 00:30:50,880
Can't you see that?

773
00:30:51,720 --> 00:30:52,480
What are those soldiers

774
00:30:53,800 --> 00:30:55,160
doing so late at night?

775
00:30:55,440 --> 00:30:56,520
Reporting to the Commander,

776
00:30:56,640 --> 00:30:57,440
it's bright over here,

777
00:30:57,520 --> 00:30:58,600
so we're training here for a bit.

778
00:30:59,920 --> 00:31:00,800
Keep lying.

779
00:31:01,040 --> 00:31:02,320
Just keep making things up.

780
00:31:07,600 --> 00:31:08,880
Just like Section Chief Liu,

781
00:31:08,920 --> 00:31:10,320
I was worried, so I went to take a look.

782
00:31:10,440 --> 00:31:11,240
Guo Zijian,

783
00:31:11,920 --> 00:31:13,760
if you really didn't hit him,

784
00:31:13,760 --> 00:31:15,920
do you have any suspects?

785
00:31:16,080 --> 00:31:17,440
Who do you think hit him?

786
00:31:18,400 --> 00:31:19,480
I don't know that.

787
00:31:20,280 --> 00:31:21,920
Regarding Section Chief Liu getting beaten,

788
00:31:21,920 --> 00:31:22,840
I also feel very sorry.

789
00:31:23,680 --> 00:31:26,200
But relying on this baseless

790
00:31:26,200 --> 00:31:27,120
so-called evidence

791
00:31:27,360 --> 00:31:28,760
to slander me as the culprit...

792
00:31:28,880 --> 00:31:29,760
I refuse to accept it.

793
00:31:29,920 --> 00:31:31,400
This isn't enough evidence?

794
00:31:31,400 --> 00:31:32,720
And you still have the nerve to argue!

795
00:31:32,720 --> 00:31:33,680
Section Chief Liu, Section Chief Liu!

796
00:31:34,000 --> 00:31:35,280
Calm down first.

797
00:31:36,240 --> 00:31:39,280
The organization will investigate this.

798
00:31:40,480 --> 00:31:41,280
Old Suo,

799
00:31:41,720 --> 00:31:43,320
why don't you take Section Chief Liu

800
00:31:43,320 --> 00:31:44,720
to the clinic for a checkup first?

801
00:31:50,440 --> 00:31:51,480
Guo Zijian.

802
00:31:52,760 --> 00:31:54,440
In short, this incident

803
00:31:54,880 --> 00:31:56,600
is extremely serious.

804
00:31:57,280 --> 00:31:58,840
I'm giving you one night

805
00:31:59,120 --> 00:32:00,280
to think it over carefully.

806
00:32:00,600 --> 00:32:01,480
First thing tomorrow morning,

807
00:32:01,680 --> 00:32:03,240
I expect you to give me,

808
00:32:03,640 --> 00:32:04,840
the training unit,

809
00:32:05,080 --> 00:32:06,080
and the brigade party committee

810
00:32:06,560 --> 00:32:09,640
a clear and definitive answer.

811
00:32:10,560 --> 00:32:11,240
Yes, sir.

812
00:32:12,840 --> 00:32:13,560
Let's go.

813
00:32:14,200 --> 00:32:15,480
Commander Suo, are we letting this go?

814
00:32:15,520 --> 00:32:16,240
Let's go.

815
00:32:21,000 --> 00:32:22,000
Take the sack with you.

816
00:32:32,720 --> 00:32:33,400
Guo Zijian

817
00:32:35,200 --> 00:32:37,080
What am I supposed to say to you?

818
00:32:38,600 --> 00:32:40,960
I hoped as Logistics Support Team Leader

819
00:32:41,800 --> 00:32:44,240
to seize the opportunity and perform well.

820
00:32:44,680 --> 00:32:45,760
Is this how you perform?

821
00:32:46,040 --> 00:32:47,760
Director, I really didn't hit him.

822
00:32:47,760 --> 00:32:49,960
But all the evidence points to you now.

823
00:32:50,240 --> 00:32:52,200
Section Chief Liu insists you did it.

824
00:32:52,200 --> 00:32:53,040
How do you explain that?

825
00:32:53,280 --> 00:32:54,800
The incident with the pot isn't even over yet,

826
00:32:54,880 --> 00:32:56,280
and now you've caused this mess.

827
00:32:56,480 --> 00:32:57,400
What are you trying to do?

828
00:32:58,080 --> 00:32:59,600
Will you only rest when you're stripped of your uniform?

829
00:32:59,600 --> 00:33:01,240
No, what he's saying is ridiculous.

830
00:33:01,240 --> 00:33:02,520
Would I even stoop to hitting him?

831
00:33:02,760 --> 00:33:03,480
Besides,

832
00:33:03,480 --> 00:33:05,120
I'm not the only one who dislikes him.

833
00:33:05,160 --> 00:33:05,760
All right then.

834
00:33:05,960 --> 00:33:07,080
You say you didn't hit him.

835
00:33:07,400 --> 00:33:09,440
Then find out who did.

836
00:33:11,160 --> 00:33:12,800
Even if there are personal grudges,

837
00:33:13,040 --> 00:33:14,880
they should be settled honorably.

838
00:33:15,280 --> 00:33:16,600
Stabbing someone in the back,

839
00:33:16,800 --> 00:33:17,760
what kind of comrade does that?

840
00:33:18,000 --> 00:33:19,040
What is a comrade?

841
00:33:19,320 --> 00:33:21,520
Who takes a bullet for you in battle.

842
00:33:22,240 --> 00:33:24,040
A unit that can win battles

843
00:33:24,040 --> 00:33:25,760
must have absolute trust

844
00:33:25,760 --> 00:33:27,000
and absolute unity.

845
00:33:28,800 --> 00:33:31,000
What happened tonight is unacceptable.

846
00:33:32,080 --> 00:33:32,720
Yes, sir.

847
00:33:33,440 --> 00:33:34,640
I'll investigate immediately

848
00:33:35,040 --> 00:33:36,240
and give you an answer as soon as possible.

849
00:33:36,440 --> 00:33:37,120
First movement.

850
00:33:37,520 --> 00:33:38,240
Kill!

851
00:33:39,280 --> 00:33:39,960
The battalion commander is here.

852
00:33:39,960 --> 00:33:41,640
Cut the chatter. Second movement.

853
00:33:42,160 --> 00:33:42,800
Kill!

854
00:33:42,800 --> 00:33:43,320
Kill!

855
00:33:44,120 --> 00:33:45,480
He's here. He's here. He's here.

856
00:33:46,440 --> 00:33:47,400
Third movement.

857
00:33:47,480 --> 00:33:48,000
Kill!

858
00:33:48,000 --> 00:33:48,600
Kill!

859
00:33:48,600 --> 00:33:49,080
Kill!

860
00:33:49,760 --> 00:33:50,840
Fourth movement.

861
00:33:51,000 --> 00:33:52,160
Kill!

862
00:33:53,640 --> 00:33:54,160
Fall in!

863
00:33:57,720 --> 00:33:58,440
Battalion Commander.

864
00:33:59,000 --> 00:34:00,960
Need us to run any errands?

865
00:34:19,360 --> 00:34:21,480
Deputy Commander Suo and Director Xu asked for you.

866
00:34:21,679 --> 00:34:23,239
You're still up this late?

867
00:34:31,159 --> 00:34:32,600
Tonight, Liu Wangyuan...

868
00:34:32,960 --> 00:34:34,600
...got beaten up on the training ground.

869
00:34:35,800 --> 00:34:37,600
The commanders asked me about the situation.

870
00:34:38,159 --> 00:34:38,760
Battalion Commander.

871
00:34:38,920 --> 00:34:39,719
Section Chief Liu...

872
00:34:40,000 --> 00:34:41,239
...isn't exactly popular anyway.

873
00:34:41,239 --> 00:34:42,159
Who knows who he offended.

874
00:34:42,159 --> 00:34:42,880
Don't you think?

875
00:34:51,800 --> 00:34:53,400
Where were you guys around 9:00 PM?

876
00:34:53,400 --> 00:34:53,840
We...

877
00:34:53,840 --> 00:34:54,800
...were right here sparring.

878
00:34:55,080 --> 00:34:55,880
We didn't go anywhere.

879
00:35:46,120 --> 00:35:46,920
Go back and get some rest.

880
00:35:47,600 --> 00:35:48,400
Yes, sir.

881
00:35:57,840 --> 00:35:58,680
Do you think

882
00:35:59,080 --> 00:35:59,960
they spotted us?

883
00:36:00,200 --> 00:36:01,120
You idiot.

884
00:36:01,320 --> 00:36:02,560
If they had, would we still stand here?

885
00:36:03,840 --> 00:36:04,560
Don't worry.

886
00:36:04,720 --> 00:36:05,640
As long as we keep our mouths shut,

887
00:36:05,640 --> 00:36:06,920
nobody can do anything to us.

888
00:36:07,280 --> 00:36:08,920
I regret it so much right now.

889
00:36:08,920 --> 00:36:09,640
I mean,

890
00:36:09,920 --> 00:36:11,400
how could we be so unlucky?

891
00:36:11,480 --> 00:36:12,880
We could have hit anyone else,

892
00:36:13,120 --> 00:36:14,400
but it just had to be Petty Liu.

893
00:36:14,400 --> 00:36:15,720
Cut the crap.

894
00:36:15,720 --> 00:36:16,720
Did you hit him or not?

895
00:36:23,760 --> 00:36:24,800
I was the one who hit Liu Wangyuan.

896
00:36:25,400 --> 00:36:27,280
I'm willing to accept disciplinary action.

897
00:36:32,680 --> 00:36:34,920
Then why didn't you admit it last night?

898
00:36:35,280 --> 00:36:37,400
Because Liu Wangyuan had no solid evidence

899
00:36:37,520 --> 00:36:38,600
to prove that I did it.

900
00:36:38,880 --> 00:36:40,680
So I took my chances,

901
00:36:40,800 --> 00:36:41,960
thinking I could escape punishment.

902
00:36:42,360 --> 00:36:44,200
Think carefully before you speak.

903
00:36:45,640 --> 00:36:46,360
Let me ask you,

904
00:36:46,920 --> 00:36:48,520
did you already find out who did it?

905
00:36:48,720 --> 00:36:49,320
No.

906
00:36:49,480 --> 00:36:50,360
It was me.

907
00:36:51,320 --> 00:36:52,240
Guo Zijian,

908
00:36:54,160 --> 00:36:55,120
do you know,

909
00:36:55,520 --> 00:36:57,360
once this is confirmed,

910
00:36:57,480 --> 00:36:58,920
what consequences you will face?

911
00:36:59,120 --> 00:37:00,480
Whatever the consequences are,

912
00:37:02,120 --> 00:37:03,040
I accept them.

913
00:37:05,080 --> 00:37:06,640
I really didn't expect

914
00:37:07,240 --> 00:37:09,520
you would sink this low.

915
00:37:12,120 --> 00:37:12,920
Chief Xu,

916
00:37:13,600 --> 00:37:14,440
Deputy Brigade Commander Suo,

917
00:37:17,960 --> 00:37:18,760
I am sorry.

918
00:37:19,560 --> 00:37:20,960
I let you down.

919
00:37:27,480 --> 00:37:28,760
This morning,

920
00:37:29,600 --> 00:37:31,640
after a night of consideration, Guo Zijian

921
00:37:31,920 --> 00:37:33,200
officially admitted to me

922
00:37:33,760 --> 00:37:35,400
and Director Xu

923
00:37:36,080 --> 00:37:37,400
that the sack incident

924
00:37:37,960 --> 00:37:39,400
was his doing alone.

925
00:37:39,760 --> 00:37:40,440
No, no, no.

926
00:37:40,720 --> 00:37:41,920
No matter how you look at it,

927
00:37:41,920 --> 00:37:43,440
I don't believe he did it.

928
00:37:43,920 --> 00:37:44,400
True.

929
00:37:44,720 --> 00:37:47,840
Guo Zijian can be a bit childish,

930
00:37:47,960 --> 00:37:50,280
and his words and actions aren't always mature.

931
00:37:50,440 --> 00:37:52,440
Sometimes he even acts a bit extreme.

932
00:37:52,960 --> 00:37:54,800
But based on what I know of him,

933
00:37:54,800 --> 00:37:56,560
he is honorable and aboveboard.

934
00:37:56,960 --> 00:37:59,520
These dirty tricks of messing with people,

935
00:37:59,560 --> 00:38:00,560
he simply wouldn't stoop to them.

936
00:38:00,600 --> 00:38:02,320
That's because he wasn't pushed to the edge.

937
00:38:03,520 --> 00:38:05,120
According to Liu Wangyuan,

938
00:38:05,240 --> 00:38:07,840
he obtained video evidence of Guo Zijian

939
00:38:07,880 --> 00:38:11,160
purposely stalling the decapitation strike.

940
00:38:11,560 --> 00:38:12,240
Evidence?

941
00:38:13,440 --> 00:38:14,600
And yesterday morning,

942
00:38:14,720 --> 00:38:15,960
he confronted him directly.

943
00:38:17,120 --> 00:38:18,840
So Guo Zijian panicked,

944
00:38:18,840 --> 00:38:20,560
and even threatened to deal with him.

945
00:38:20,920 --> 00:38:21,520
And look,

946
00:38:21,520 --> 00:38:22,400
as soon as night fell,

947
00:38:22,520 --> 00:38:23,320
the incident happened.

948
00:38:24,040 --> 00:38:25,840
Video of delaying the decapitation strike?

949
00:38:26,600 --> 00:38:27,280
Is the evidence conclusive?

950
00:38:27,280 --> 00:38:28,680
It's clear as day.

951
00:38:29,760 --> 00:38:31,200
The facts are there.

952
00:38:31,320 --> 00:38:32,320
How could there be such a coincidence?

953
00:38:32,320 --> 00:38:33,200
Just one second off.

954
00:38:34,000 --> 00:38:36,400
A coincidence doesn't mean it's impossible.

955
00:38:36,960 --> 00:38:37,640
Commissar.

956
00:38:40,160 --> 00:38:40,960
I know.

957
00:38:41,520 --> 00:38:42,720
Emotionally speaking,

958
00:38:42,920 --> 00:38:44,360
you don't want to believe this.

959
00:38:44,360 --> 00:38:45,360
I didn't believe it at first either.

960
00:38:45,360 --> 00:38:46,320
But now I do.

961
00:38:48,320 --> 00:38:49,160
This kid

962
00:38:49,680 --> 00:38:52,120
most likely held back during the drill.

963
00:38:52,120 --> 00:38:53,040
Do you know why?

964
00:38:54,560 --> 00:38:56,720
We removed him as battalion commander.

965
00:38:57,000 --> 00:38:59,360
He held a grudge and took it to heart.

966
00:39:04,120 --> 00:39:04,960
To be honest,

967
00:39:06,040 --> 00:39:07,480
through this drill,

968
00:39:07,880 --> 00:39:08,840
I admit

969
00:39:08,960 --> 00:39:10,440
he is indeed capable.

970
00:39:10,720 --> 00:39:12,080
He fought a beautiful battle.

971
00:39:12,880 --> 00:39:14,880
But you can't let personal emotions

972
00:39:14,880 --> 00:39:17,120
override collective honor.

973
00:39:17,800 --> 00:39:18,600
Besides,

974
00:39:19,000 --> 00:39:20,200
in just a few days,

975
00:39:20,280 --> 00:39:21,200
look how many things happened.

976
00:39:22,200 --> 00:39:23,160
The pot-kicking incident,

977
00:39:23,560 --> 00:39:24,600
the decapitation strike incident,

978
00:39:24,760 --> 00:39:25,880
and the sack incident.

979
00:39:26,200 --> 00:39:27,360
Every single one of these

980
00:39:27,400 --> 00:39:29,600
has become an unexplained mystery.

981
00:39:29,960 --> 00:39:30,600
This kind of person

982
00:39:30,600 --> 00:39:32,880
is absolutely not a qualified commander.

983
00:39:33,640 --> 00:39:35,120
How do you expect me to trust him?

984
00:39:37,680 --> 00:39:38,280
Yes.

985
00:39:39,000 --> 00:39:39,760
Loyalty,

986
00:39:40,240 --> 00:39:41,680
first and foremost, requires

987
00:39:42,120 --> 00:39:44,080
overcoming personal emotions and motives.

988
00:39:44,200 --> 00:39:45,480
He couldn't overcome them.

989
00:39:46,120 --> 00:39:46,920
Old Suo,

990
00:39:47,440 --> 00:39:48,120
this incident

991
00:39:48,600 --> 00:39:50,240
will have a huge impact on Guo Zijian.

992
00:39:50,600 --> 00:39:51,560
I'll say it again.

993
00:39:51,640 --> 00:39:54,000
I still don't think he'd be so irrational.

994
00:39:54,000 --> 00:39:55,520
He was irrational.

995
00:39:55,600 --> 00:39:56,600
Let's investigate further.

996
00:39:56,680 --> 00:39:57,760
What's there to investigate now?

997
00:39:57,960 --> 00:39:59,200
He admitted it himself.

998
00:39:59,560 --> 00:40:00,960
Witnesses, physical evidence,

999
00:40:00,960 --> 00:40:01,960
the culprit's confession...

1000
00:40:02,040 --> 00:40:03,120
What culprit's confession?

1001
00:40:03,120 --> 00:40:05,000
In the civilian world, he'd be arrested already.

1002
00:40:05,000 --> 00:40:05,840
You're exaggerating.

1003
00:40:10,880 --> 00:40:11,760
Commissar

1004
00:40:16,520 --> 00:40:17,560
I know

1005
00:40:17,800 --> 00:40:19,560
you value talent.

1006
00:40:20,360 --> 00:40:21,560
But Guo Zijian...

1007
00:40:21,640 --> 00:40:23,120
He smashed someone else's pot,

1008
00:40:23,200 --> 00:40:25,520
we still put him on the Logistics Support Team.

1009
00:40:26,280 --> 00:40:27,760
But does he know how to cherish it?

1010
00:40:29,280 --> 00:40:31,240
Is he worthy of his uniform?

1011
00:40:33,000 --> 00:40:34,040
Besides,

1012
00:40:34,760 --> 00:40:37,840
Liu Wangyuan is very emotionally unstable right now.

1013
00:40:37,840 --> 00:40:39,160
He repeatedly reiterated to me

1014
00:40:39,160 --> 00:40:40,640
that if the brigade party committee

1015
00:40:40,720 --> 00:40:42,360
doesn't handle this matter impartially,

1016
00:40:43,160 --> 00:40:45,240
he'll report it up the chain of command,

1017
00:40:45,240 --> 00:40:46,800
until justice is served.

1018
00:40:48,520 --> 00:40:49,240
Old Suo,

1019
00:40:49,720 --> 00:40:51,760
Liu Wangyuan usually listens to you.

1020
00:40:51,760 --> 00:40:53,600
You can't let him cause more trouble.

1021
00:40:53,800 --> 00:40:54,800
Don't worry about that.

1022
00:40:54,880 --> 00:40:56,240
I'll talk to him.

1023
00:40:57,480 --> 00:40:58,240
All right.

1024
00:40:58,960 --> 00:41:00,040
Convene a party committee meeting.

1025
00:41:00,680 --> 00:41:03,320
To discuss how to deal with Guo Zijian.

1026
00:41:11,720 --> 00:41:12,120
Staff Officer Liang,

1027
00:41:12,480 --> 00:41:13,520
I need to report something.

1028
00:41:13,640 --> 00:41:14,480
Go ahead.

1029
00:41:15,280 --> 00:41:16,960
Someone copied a segment of

1030
00:41:16,960 --> 00:41:19,120
the drill inspection video from days ago.

1031
00:41:19,280 --> 00:41:20,160
So what?

1032
00:41:21,080 --> 00:41:23,080
Isn't it good to review after a drill?

1033
00:41:23,120 --> 00:41:24,120
Is there a problem?

1034
00:41:24,280 --> 00:41:25,480
A huge problem.

1035
00:41:25,480 --> 00:41:27,480
The person who copied the video is Liu Wangyuan.

1036
00:41:27,560 --> 00:41:30,000
He only copied Guo Zijian and Yang Maolin

1037
00:41:30,000 --> 00:41:31,360
carrying out the decapitation strike.

1038
00:41:31,720 --> 00:41:32,640
Why

1039
00:41:33,240 --> 00:41:33,960
copy this part?

1040
00:41:33,960 --> 00:41:35,160
Is there a problem with this part?

1041
00:41:35,520 --> 00:41:36,400
Did you forget?

1042
00:41:36,400 --> 00:41:38,200
This part caused the most controversy

1043
00:41:38,200 --> 00:41:39,320
in the entire exercise.

1044
00:41:39,520 --> 00:41:40,360
Moreover,

1045
00:41:40,640 --> 00:41:42,080
many people say

1046
00:41:42,080 --> 00:41:44,120
Guo Zijian purposely let Long Yuanshan go.

1047
00:41:44,360 --> 00:41:46,280
Section Chief Liu has also been investigating this.

1048
00:41:46,560 --> 00:41:48,600
He's certain Guo Zijian hit him,

1049
00:41:48,640 --> 00:41:49,840
probably because of this.

1050
00:41:52,480 --> 00:41:53,240
No way.

1051
00:41:53,240 --> 00:41:54,880
Guo Zijian couldn't have hit anyone.

1052
00:41:55,320 --> 00:41:56,800
It was so hard for him to get into the training team.

1053
00:41:56,800 --> 00:41:58,000
He wouldn't be that irrational.

1054
00:41:58,640 --> 00:41:59,640
I think so too.

1055
00:42:00,040 --> 00:42:01,760
But who knows what he's thinking?

1056
00:42:01,760 --> 00:42:02,920
He actually admitted it.

1057
00:42:06,280 --> 00:42:08,160
Then it must be because he knows who it is,

1058
00:42:08,160 --> 00:42:09,520
and wants to protect them.

1059
00:42:10,000 --> 00:42:11,720
Seeing how he almost got discharged

1060
00:42:11,880 --> 00:42:13,200
because of the Wu Dongsheng incident,

1061
00:42:13,840 --> 00:42:15,960
you can tell what kind of personality he has.

1062
00:42:16,240 --> 00:42:17,360
He's typically protective of his own.

1063
00:42:20,800 --> 00:42:22,640
Is Liu Wangyuan badly hurt?

1064
00:42:22,840 --> 00:42:23,880
Badly hurt?

1065
00:42:23,960 --> 00:42:26,880
The clinic said he wasn't even scratched.

1066
00:42:27,200 --> 00:42:27,880
However,

1067
00:42:27,880 --> 00:42:29,640
if he makes an issue of the video,

1068
00:42:29,640 --> 00:42:31,920
then Guo Zijian is in real trouble.

1069
00:42:32,200 --> 00:42:33,840
Wouldn't we both become accomplices?

1070
00:42:38,440 --> 00:42:40,680
What kind of luck does Guo Zijian have?

1071
00:42:41,320 --> 00:42:42,920
Why is he so unlucky?

1072
00:42:49,760 --> 00:42:51,640
Maybe we can do something.
